  <data name="PlaceToompeaName" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Toompea Castle</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceToompeaShort" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A medieval center of power with views of the old town.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceToompeaDetail" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Toompea Castle is one of Tallinn's most important historic sites. It houses the Estonian parliament, and nearby viewpoints give a beautiful look over the old town.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceOldTownName" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Town Hall Square</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceOldTownShort" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The heart of the old town with cafes and historic houses.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceOldTownDetail" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Town Hall Square is the center of Tallinn's old town. Narrow cobblestone streets begin here, markets are held here, and it is a good starting point for a walk.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceKadriorgName" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Kadriorg Park</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceKadriorgShort" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A peaceful park with a palace, museums, and flower gardens.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceKadriorgDetail" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Kadriorg Park is perfect for a calm walk. The park has Kadriorg Palace, nearby KUMU, ponds, and avenues that make it one of Tallinn's best loved green areas.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlacePiritaName" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pirita Promenade</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlacePiritaShort" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A seaside path for walking and cycling.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlacePiritaDetail" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Pirita Promenade brings together sea air, city views, and active movement. It is a good place for a morning run, bike ride, or relaxed evening walk.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceMarketName" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Balti Jaama Market</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceMarketShort" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A lively market with street food and local flavors.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceMarketDetail" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Balti Jaama Market combines fresh food, street food, cafes, and small shops. It works well for a quick lunch or for discovering local flavors.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceTelliskiviName" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Telliskivi Creative City</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceTelliskiviShort" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Cafes, restaurants, art, and a creative atmosphere.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="PlaceTelliskiviDetail" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Telliskivi Creative City is a popular area with restaurants, galleries, design shops, and events. It is a good choice when you want to see Tallinn's modern side.</value>
